{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45586","headline":"古意九首 七 · 贯休","name":"古意九首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思谢康乐，文章有神力。\n是何清风清，凛然似相识。\n一种爲顽嚚，得作翻经石。\n一种爲枯槁，得作登山屐。\n永嘉爲郡後，山水添鲜碧。\n何当学羽翰，一去观遗迹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}